,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-16T17:37:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:31Z","closed_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.stable (oldest version with wireframe in Compatibility), 4.6.stable, 4.7.dev 43c9a32b3d46f1333ee80b1e48ae77f8bf04b345\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (40448082a) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.119.02) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe wireframe debug draw mode (or `render_mode wireframe;` in a custom shader) displays backfaces in Compatibility, but not Forward+/Mobile.\n\nShaders that use `FRONT_FACING` are also ignored in Compatibility (the red sphere with green backfaces loses its green wireframes in Compatibility):\n\nForward+/Mobile | Compatibility\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/307c8ead-841a-4d14-aa20-6b4fde3087d4\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"619\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/985c15c0-fe23-4193-8279-7ebf577553be\" />\n\nThis inconsistency in appearance can be misleading if you are looking at wireframe mode to troubleshoot procedural mesh generation. I would lean towards making Compatibility not show wireframe backfaces (unless the material is double-sided), for consistency with Forward+/Mobile.\n\n**Edit:** According to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14220#issuecomment-3910486793, this is a design limitation:\n\n> Compatibility does not have backface culling for wireframes, because it uses a generated mesh of lines rather than glPolygonMode (presumably because this is not supported in WebGL without [an extension](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_polygon_mode/) which does not have wide support, particularly on mobile devices).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Change the debug draw mode in the 3D editor's Perspective menu to **Display Wireframe** while using the Compatibility renderer.\n- Alternatively, use the wireframe debug draw mode at runtime by calling `get_viewport().get_viewport().debug_draw = Viewport.DEBUG_DRAW_WIREFRAME` in the main scene's `_ready()` function. Make sure you have this autoload script set up if you do that:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n        RenderingServer.set_debug_generate_wireframes(true)\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_wireframe_backface.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25346745/test_wireframe_backface.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116364/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116364/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"com